label qst_NewMyu_primer:
    show myu at cright_f with dissolve
    show mc at cleft with easeinleft
    MYU @talk "Hello."
    MC @talk "Myu?"
    MC @talk "Is everything okay?"
    MYU @sad "Y-Yes."
    MYU @talk "Myu is fine, wish to talk about something though."
    MC @talk "What is it?"
    MYU @blush "C-Could..."
    MYU @blush "We try eat sweet rolls and things?"
    MC @think "Sweet rolls?"
    MYU @blush "And I want to try w-wine too."
    MC @talk "What's brought this on?"
    MYU @talk "Myu... Wants to try something different."
    MC @talk "Are you sure you can eat those things?"
    MC @talk "I mean-"
    MYU @angry "Myu can eat! MYU CAN EAT!"
    MC @sad "..."
    MYU @sad "Sorry, Myu not sure what came over her there."
    MYU @sad "Myu just wants to try, is that wrong?"
    MC @smile "No, Myu, of course not."
    MC @talk "I'll bring you some later."
    MYU @smile "Thank you! Myu can't wait!"
    $ QstComplete(PrimerQstNewMyu)
    $ LocEnter()